{"path": "/en/norway-on-a-budget", "title": "Norway on a Budget: How to Save Money Eating Out | BIMM", "styles": ["/reference/1f65bfd9ce6a89dd.css", "/reference/38b1dea288c4762f.css"], "bodyClass": "nacellefont_2a5c70b4-module__-Y0KqG__className flex flex-col flex-1 w-full h-full bimm", "html": "<div hidden=\"\"><!--$--><!--/$--></div><div data-overlay-container=\"true\" class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><div class=\"flex flex-col flex-1\"><nav class=\"flex w-full h-auto items-center justify-center data-[menu-open=true]:border-none sticky top-0 inset-x-0 bg-ds-bg-warm/90 backdrop-blur-md z-50\" style=\"--navbar-height:4rem;transform:none\"><header class=\"z-40 flex gap-4 w-full flex-row relative flex-nowrap items-center justify-between h-[var(--navbar-height)] px-5 md:px-10 lg:px-[40px] xl:px-[100px] 2xl:px-[200px] py-[15px] max-w-none\"><ul class=\"flex gap-4 h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0\" data-justify=\"start\"><a class=\"flex basis-0 flex-row flex-grow flex-nowrap justify-start bg-transparent items-center no-underline text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border shrink-0 !basis-auto !flex-grow-0\" href=\"/\"><img alt=\"BIMM\" width=\"989\" height=\"293\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"1\" class=\"w-[100px] md:w-[130px] h-auto\" style=\"color:transparent\" src=\"/reference/2845d56155219054.png\"/></a></ul><ul class=\"h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 hidden lg:flex gap-5 xl:gap-[49px]\" data-justify=\"center\"><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"#what-is-bimm\">What is BIMM</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"#how-it-works\">How it works</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"/deals\">Our Deals</a></li><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap text-[16px] font-normal tracking-[-0.32px] text-ds-text-black hover:opacity-70 transition-opacity\" href=\"/blog\">Blog</a></li></ul><ul class=\"h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 hidden lg:flex gap-3\" data-justify=\"end\"><li class=\"text-medium whitespace-nowrap box-border list-none data-[active=true]:font-semibold\"><a class=\"whitespace-nowrap flex items-center justify-center h-[51px] px-[26px] rounded-[14px] bg-white text-ds-text-black text-[20px] font-bold tracking-[-0.2px] shadow-[0px_4px_7.8px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.04)] hover:bg-gray-50 transition-colors\" href=\"/#download\">Download the App</a></li></ul><ul class=\"flex gap-4 h-full flex-row flex-nowrap items-center data-[justify=start]:justify-start data-[justify=start]:flex-grow data-[justify=start]:basis-0 data-[justify=center]:justify-center data-[justify=end]:justify-end data-[justify=end]:flex-grow data-[justify=end]:basis-0 lg:hidden !flex-grow-0\" data-justify=\"end\"><button class=\"group flex items-center justify-center tap-highlight-transparent outline-solid outline-transparent data-[focus-visible=true]:z-10 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-2 data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-focus data-[focus-visible=true]:outline-offset-2 w-[42px] h-[42px] rounded-[16.8px] bg-ds-bg-off shadow-[0px_2.52px_12.6px_0px_rgba(0,0,0,0.02)]\" type=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" data-react-aria-pressable=\"true\" aria-label=\"Open menu\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><span class=\"sr-only\">open navigation menu</span><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 22 22\" fill=\"none\"><path d=\"M4 7h14M4 11h14M4 15h14\" stroke=\"black\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"></path></svg></button></ul></header></nav><main class=\"flex flex-col flex-1 items-center min-w-36\"><section class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1120px] px-5 md:px-10 py-12 md:py-16\"><nav aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\" class=\"text-[13px] text-black/50 mb-4\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"/\">BIMM</a><span class=\"mx-1.5\">/</span><span class=\"text-black/70\">Norway on a budget</span></nav><h1 class=\"text-[30px] md:text-[44px] font-semibold tracking-[-1px] leading-tight\">Eating out in Norway <span class=\"text-ds-brand-emerald\">on a budget</span></h1><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Norway — and Oslo especially — can be expensive to eat out in. Many locals cut the cost with deals apps that get them member prices at restaurants and cafés, and visitors can use them in exactly the same way.</p><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[16px] md:text-[18px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">BIMM is a subscription deals app for eating out in Norway. Premium is 49 NOK a month, or 295 NOK a year (24.58 NOK/month) — cancel anytime, no hidden fees — and gets you live 2-for-1 meals, fixed-krone discounts and free items at partner restaurants and cafés, primarily in Oslo. Loyalty stamp cards on BIMM are free and don&#x27;t require a subscription.</p><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"BIMM in Oslo, by the numbers\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">BIMM in Oslo, by the numbers</h2><div class=\"mt-6\"><section aria-label=\"Deal statistics\"><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 sm:grid-cols-4 gap-3\"><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">100</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Active deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">48</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Venues with deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">20–478 NOK</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Savings per visit</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">≈ 109 NOK</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Average saving</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">10</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">2-for-1 deals</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">62</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Fixed discounts</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">28</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Free items</p></div><div class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-4 md:p-5\"><p class=\"text-[24px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] tabular-nums leading-tight\">103</p><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50 mt-1\">Loyalty stamp cards</p></div></div><p class=\"text-black/70 text-[15px] md:text-[16px] leading-relaxed mt-5 max-w-[820px]\">As of October 2026, BIMM lists 100 active deals at 48 restaurants and cafés in Oslo, with savings from 20 to 478 NOK per visit (about 109 NOK on average), plus 103 free loyalty stamp cards.</p><p class=\"text-black/40 text-[13px] mt-2\">Updated October 2026 · live counts from the BIMM app</p></section></div></section><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"How BIMM works for visitors\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">How BIMM works for visitors</h2><ol class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Step<!-- --> <!-- -->1</p><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold mt-1\">Download the free app</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1\">BIMM is free to download on iOS and Android. Browsing venues and collecting loyalty stamps costs nothing.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Step<!-- --> <!-- -->2</p><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold mt-1\">Subscribe to BIMM Premium</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1\">Deals require the subscription — 49 NOK/mo or 295 NOK/yr (24.58 NOK/mo). Cancel anytime, no hidden fees.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Step<!-- --> <!-- -->3</p><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold mt-1\">Browse deals and book a time</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1\">Pick a deal — a 2-for-1 meal, a fixed-krone discount or a free item — and book a date and time in the app. Some deals run on specific days or time windows; the app shows this up front.</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><p class=\"text-[13px] font-bold uppercase tracking-wide text-black/50\">Step<!-- --> <!-- -->4</p><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold mt-1\">Show up and swipe to check in</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-1\">At the venue, swipe to check in inside the app. No coupons, no vouchers, no codes to print.</p></li></ol><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[14px] mt-5\">Get the app:<!-- --> <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/bimm/id6482481057\" class=\"underline hover:no-underline\">App Store</a> · <a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=bimm.app.BIMM\" class=\"underline hover:no-underline\">Google Play</a></p><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[14px] mt-3 max-w-[760px]\">Traveling with someone who already uses BIMM? With invite-a-friend, you and your friend each get a month of Premium free.</p><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[14px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">Studying or working in Norway? Some universities and employers have approved email domains that unlock BIMM Premium at no cost — verify your university or work email in the app to check. Access is re-confirmed periodically.</p></section><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"Practical ways to eat well for less in Norway\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Practical ways to eat well for less in Norway</h2><ul class=\"mt-6 flex flex-col gap-5 max-w-[820px]\"><li><h3 class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-semibold\">Time your meals around deal windows</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Many restaurant deals run on specific days or off-peak hours — a weekday dinner can come with a better offer than a Saturday night. BIMM shows each deal&#x27;s days and time windows up front, so you can plan meals around them.</p></li><li><h3 class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-semibold\">Share 2-for-1 meals</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Two-for-one deals are the simplest win for couples and friends traveling together: one dish paid, two served. Fixed-krone discounts and free items work just as well for solo travelers.</p></li><li><h3 class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-semibold\">Collect loyalty stamps at coffee shops and bakeries</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Stamp cards on BIMM are free and work without a subscription. Buy your morning coffee at the same place each day and the stamps quietly add up to a reward.</p></li><li><h3 class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-semibold\">Drink tap water — and watch the bar tab</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Tap water in Norway is excellent and free, and restaurants will serve it if you ask. Alcohol, on the other hand, is heavily taxed, so drinks are often where a dinner bill grows fastest.</p></li><li><h3 class=\"text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-semibold\">Go big at lunch</h3><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed mt-0.5\">Many restaurants offer lunch menus that are friendlier than their dinner menus, and bakeries make a solid budget lunch on their own. Supermarkets cover picnic days surprisingly well.</p></li></ul></section><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"Real deals on BIMM right now\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Real deals on BIMM right now</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">A live sample of what members can book in Oslo — sorted by the amount you save per visit.</p><ul class=\"mt-6 grid gap-4 md:grid-cols-2\"><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/vineandolive\">Vine&amp;Olive</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">A seafood tasting set  — Save 478 NOK</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/venue-bar-and-restaurant\">Venue Bar &amp; Restaurant</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">2for1 Burger Course — 2 for 1 — save approx 367 NOK</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/spillbaren-majorstuen\">Spillbaren Majorstuen</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">HALF PRICE Darts — Save 325 NOK</p><p class=\"text-black/55 text-[13px] mt-1\">Available: Thu 4pm–12am</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/johnny-rockets-storo\">Johnny Rockets Storo</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">20% OFF Your Total — Save 300 NOK</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-nydalen\">Mamma Pizza Nydalen</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">2for1 Diavola or Formaggi — 2 for 1 — save approx 276 NOK</p></li><li class=\"rounded-[20px] border border-black/10 bg-white/60 p-5 md:p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-[17px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.3px]\"><a class=\"hover:underline\" href=\"https://bimm.app/location/mamma-pizza-osteria-italiana\">Mamma Pizza Osteria Italiana</a></h3><p class=\"text-[15px] font-medium mt-1\">2for1 Pizza Diavola — 2 for 1 — save approx 275 NOK</p></li></ul><p class=\"text-black/40 text-[13px] mt-4\">Deals change, and many have day or time windows, cooldowns between uses and daily limits — the app always shows the live list.<!-- --> <a class=\"underline hover:no-underline text-black/60\" href=\"/deals\">Browse all deals</a></p></section><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"Where BIMM works\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px]\">Where BIMM works</h2><p class=\"text-black/60 text-[15px] mt-2 max-w-[760px]\">BIMM works primarily in Oslo, plus a few other cities. Each city page lists every partner venue with its current deals and loyalty programs.</p><ul class=\"mt-5 flex flex-col gap-2 text-[15px]\"><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/oslo\">Oslo</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->71 venues<!-- -->, 48 with active deals</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/lillestrom\">Lillestrøm</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue<!-- -->, 1 with active deals</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/moss\">Moss</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue<!-- -->, 1 with active deals</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/sandvika\">Sandvika</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue<!-- -->, 1 with active deals</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/tromso\">Tromsø</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue<!-- -->, 1 with active deals</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/budapest\">Budapest</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->8 venues</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/sandefjord\">Sandefjord</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->2 venues</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/budaors\">Budaörs</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/drammen\">Drammen</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/vestby\">Vestby</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue</span></li><li><a class=\"font-medium underline hover:no-underline\" href=\"/deals/veszprem\">Veszprém</a><span class=\"text-black/50\"> <!-- -->— <!-- -->1 venue</span></li></ul></section><section class=\"mt-12 pt-8 border-t border-black/10\" aria-label=\"Traveler FAQ: eating out in Norway on a budget\"><h2 class=\"text-[22px] md:text-[28px] font-semibold tracking-[-0.5px] mb-5\">Traveler FAQ: eating out in Norway on a budget</h2><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-2 max-w-[820px]\"><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Is Norway expensive for eating out?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Eating out in Norway — and in Oslo especially — is widely seen as expensive. That doesn&#x27;t mean you should skip restaurants: locals manage it with member prices through deals apps, lunch menus, tap water and loyalty cards, and visitors can do exactly the same.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>How can I save money on food as a tourist in Norway?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Combine a few habits: eat your bigger meal at lunch, drink tap water, use bakeries and supermarkets for casual meals, and unlock member prices with a deals app. BIMM Premium costs 49 NOK a month, or 295 NOK a year (24.58 NOK/month) — cancel anytime — and gives you 2-for-1 meals, fixed-krone discounts and free items at partner restaurants and cafés, primarily in Oslo. Loyalty stamp cards on BIMM are free without any subscription.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Does BIMM work for visitors, or only locals?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">It works exactly the same for visitors. Download the free app and subscribe to BIMM Premium in the app — 49 NOK/month, or 295 NOK/year (24.58 NOK/month) if you&#x27;re staying longer — and cancel anytime; there&#x27;s no long-term commitment, so it fits a short trip as well as a longer stay.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Which cities does BIMM cover?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Primarily Oslo — currently 71 partner restaurants and cafés on BIMM, 48 of them with active deals — plus a few other cities. The app and the city pages on this site show the live list.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>What kinds of restaurant deals are on BIMM?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">Four main kinds: 2-for-1 meals, fixed-krone discounts (a set NOK amount off), free items, and gift cards — plus free stamp-card loyalty programs at coffee shops and bakeries. Deals can be limited to certain days or time windows and have cooldowns between uses; the app shows all of this before you book.</p></details><details class=\"group border-b border-black/10 pb-2\"><summary class=\"cursor-pointer list-none flex justify-between items-center gap-4 py-2 text-[16px] md:text-[17px] font-medium\"><span>Do I need coupons or vouchers to use the deals?</span><span class=\"text-black/40 transition-transform group-open:rotate-45 text-[22px] leading-none\">+</span></summary><p class=\"text-black/65 text-[15px] leading-relaxed pb-2 pr-8\">No. There are no coupons, vouchers or codes on BIMM. You book a date and time in the app, show up, and swipe to check in on your phone at the venue — that&#x27;s the whole flow.</p></details></div></section></div></section><div class=\"w-full bg-ds-bg-warm py-10 lg:py-16\"><div class=\"w-full\"><div class=\"mx-auto max-w-[1520px] px-5 md:px-10\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-[14px] lg:hidden\"><div class=\"relative rounded-[32px] overflow-hidden h-[620px]\"><img alt=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" data-nimg=\"fill\" class=\"object-cover\" style=\"position:absolute;heigh